{"2121450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bangkok Story: A Stray Dog", "steam_appid": 2121450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4745840], "detailed_description": "<strong>Bangkok Story: A Stray Dog</strong> is a top-down 2D story-driven adventure game inspired by true events in Bangkok, Thailand 2017. The game lets you experience the harsh life of a homeless man who tries to cope with his mental struggle of the cruelty of the world. The story is framed by an interview he gives to a famous blogger, about how a chance encounter with a stray dog made him regain his sense of self once more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/98786e525f1b3096ed204e063bfe2a25.poster.avif?t=1786724520\" width=638 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/98786e525f1b3096ed204e063bfe2a25.webm?t=1786724520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/98786e525f1b3096ed204e063bfe2a25.mp4?t=1786724520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>What could make a man homeless? Is it one's family's financial situation? Is it the government? Is it because of our friends? Or... is it because of oneself?<br><br>Explore a journey from his childhood to the present. Unravel what made a man lose everything.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/4044394d696c048f7d183cdbfee0ce3e.poster.avif?t=1786724520\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/4044394d696c048f7d183cdbfee0ce3e.webm?t=1786724520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Experience the struggle of a homeless man's and a stray dog's life.<br></li><li> Traverse the life of a homeless man through his past in Thailand's rural areas.<br></li><li> Show different ways to show affections for the dog.<br></li><li> The game tells thought-provoking ways of how to live a proper life.<br></li><li> If you are sensitive about animals, friends, or family, I can't guarantee that you won't cry.</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<strong>Bangkok Story: A Stray Dog</strong> is a top-down 2D story-driven adventure game inspired by true events in Bangkok, Thailand 2017. The game lets you experience the harsh life of a homeless man who tries to cope with his mental struggle of the cruelty of the world. The story is framed by an interview he gives to a famous blogger, about how a chance encounter with a stray dog made him regain his sense of self once more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/98786e525f1b3096ed204e063bfe2a25.poster.avif?t=1786724520\" width=638 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/98786e525f1b3096ed204e063bfe2a25.webm?t=1786724520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/98786e525f1b3096ed204e063bfe2a25.mp4?t=1786724520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>What could make a man homeless? Is it one's family's financial situation? Is it the government? Is it because of our friends? Or... is it because of oneself?<br><br>Explore a journey from his childhood to the present. Unravel what made a man lose everything.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/4044394d696c048f7d183cdbfee0ce3e.poster.avif?t=1786724520\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/4044394d696c048f7d183cdbfee0ce3e.webm?t=1786724520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Experience the struggle of a homeless man's and a stray dog's life.<br></li><li> Traverse the life of a homeless man through his past in Thailand's rural areas.<br></li><li> Show different ways to show affections for the dog.<br></li><li> The game tells thought-provoking ways of how to live a proper life.<br></li><li> If you are sensitive about animals, friends, or family, I can't guarantee that you won't cry.</li></ul>", "short_description": "A top-down 2D story-driven adventure game inspired by real-life events. Traverse and experience the life of a formerly homeless man through an interview of how he regained his sense of self by telling his past to a stray dog. Set in Bangkok, Thailand 2017.", "supported_languages": "English, Thai", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/e3d407fe2be7baa8e6216e3fb4aa20ffb8c52854/header.jpg?t=1786724520", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/1dd30be4400c98e8323b22688e0e18a7acb29c7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786724520", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/1dd30be4400c98e8323b22688e0e18a7acb29c7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786724520", "website": "https://www.shamefulguys.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft Windows® 8.1/10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4340 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</st